BEGIN_DESC
MPU / EMPU and a stock Delta Glider. The KSC runway: the charging station, the EMPU and the open MPU as in "MPU - Earth, KSC", and a Delta Glider 35 m to their south, its nose towards them. The astronavigator stands before the glider's nose.
Boarding a ship that is not ours: look at the glider's nose within reach - "nose airlock" shows in the menu (Alt: the places of actions, orange). "open the airlock": the nose cone and the outer door open (as if K and O were pressed on the glider, ~20 s). "go in": she is aboard, the glider has the focus and the view - fly it.
Getting out: F on the glider, standing on the ground with the airlock open - she steps out before the nose.
Any Delta Glider in any scenario works the same (Config\OrbiterCrew\Ships\DeltaGlider.cfg); see Doc\OrbiterCrew_MPU\SHIPS.md to add other ships.
END_DESC

